<diagram program="umletino" version="15.1"><zoom_level>8</zoom_level><help_text>Backend Architecture - FastAPI Application
Layer: Presentation (API/Web) → Core (Services) → Infrastructure (DB)</help_text><element><id>UMLClass</id><coordinates><x>0</x><y>760</y><w>320</w><h>224</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Infrastructure Layer&gt;&gt;
engine.py
--
Database connection and session management
--
+ engine: Engine
+ get_session() → Generator[Session]
+ session_scope() → Generator[Session]
+ wait_for_database(max_attempts, delay)
--
Dependencies:
- SQLModel/SQLAlchemy
- PostgreSQL or SQLite
--
Pattern: Factory + Context Manager
Creates DB sessions for dependency injection</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLClass</id><coordinates><x>360</x><y>760</y><w>320</w><h>224</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Infrastructure Layer&gt;&gt;
models.py
--
ORM table definitions (SQLModel)
--
+ Course(id, code, name, grading_scale)
+ Semester(id, name, year, course_id)
+ Subject(id, code, name, semester_id, ...)
+ Assignment(id, subject_id, assessment, ...)
+ Examination(id, subject_id, exam_mark, ...)
+ ExamSettings(id, subject_id, ps_exam, ...)
+ GradeScale(id, scale_name, grade, ...)
+ CourseSubjectLink(course_id, subject_id)
--
Pattern: Active Record (ORM)
Defines database schema and relationships</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLClass</id><coordinates><x>0</x><y>440</y><w>320</w><h>240</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Core Service Layer&gt;&gt;
CourseManager
--
Manages course business logic
--
- session: Session
--
+ create_course(name, code) → Course
+ get_all_courses() → list[Course]
+ get_course_by_id(id) → Course | None
+ get_course_by_code(code) → Course | None
+ add_subject_to_course(course_id, subject_id)
+ assign_semester_to_course(course_id, sem_id)
+ assign_year_to_course(course_id, year)
+ unassign_semester_from_course(...)
+ get_unassigned_semesters() → list[Semester]
+ update_course(id, name, code) → Course
+ delete_course(id) → bool
--
Pattern: Service Layer
Encapsulates course-related operations</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLClass</id><coordinates><x>360</x><y>440</y><w>320</w><h>160</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Core Service Layer&gt;&gt;
SubjectManager
--
Manages subject business logic
--
- session: Session
--
+ get_all_subjects() → list[Subject]
--
Pattern: Service Layer
Provides subject-related operations
(Currently minimal, extensible for future)</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLClass</id><coordinates><x>720</x><y>440</y><w>320</w><h>200</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Core Service Layer&gt;&gt;
SemesterManager
--
Manages semester business logic
--
- session: Session
--
+ get_all_semesters() → list[Semester]
+ get_distinct_years() → list[int]
+ get_semesters_for_course(course_id)
+ get_distinct_years_for_course(course_id)
--
Pattern: Service Layer
Handles semester queries and aggregations
Orders results (newest first)</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLClass</id><coordinates><x>1136</x><y>440</y><w>304</w><h>240</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Core Service Layer&gt;&gt;
GradeCalculator
--
Calculates academic metrics
--
- session: Session
--
+ calculate_wam(course_id) → float | None
+ calculate_gpa(course_id) → float | None
+ calculate_grade_counts(course_id) → dict[str, int]
- _get_grade_scales(course_id) → list[GradeScale]
--
Pattern: Service Layer + Strategy
Computes WAM (weighted average mark),
GPA (grade point average), and grade distributions
Uses GradeScale from DB for configurable grading
Auto-seeds default "Standard" scale if missing</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLClass</id><coordinates><x>0</x><y>120</y><w>320</w><h>240</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Presentation Layer - API&gt;&gt;
routers/courses.py
--
FastAPI router for course endpoints
--
+ courses_router: APIRouter
--
POST   /courses/
GET    /courses/
GET    /courses/{id}
PUT    /courses/{id}
DELETE /courses/{id}
POST   /courses/{id}/semesters/{sem_id}
DELETE /courses/{id}/semesters/{sem_id}
GET    /courses/unassigned-semesters
--
Pattern: Controller (API Router)
Uses CourseManager service
Dependency injection: Depends(get_session)</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLClass</id><coordinates><x>360</x><y>120</y><w>320</w><h>240</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Presentation Layer - API&gt;&gt;
routers/subjects.py
--
FastAPI router for subject endpoints
--
+ router: APIRouter
--
GET    /subjects/
POST   /subjects/
GET    /subjects/{code}/{sem}/{year}
PUT    /subjects/{code}/{sem}/{year}
DELETE /subjects/{code}/{sem}/{year}
--
Pattern: Controller (API Router)
Uses models directly with JOINs
Validates semester existence
Dependency injection: Depends(get_session)</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLClass</id><coordinates><x>720</x><y>120</y><w>320</w><h>240</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Presentation Layer - API&gt;&gt;
routers/assignments.py
routers/exams.py
routers/semesters.py
--
FastAPI routers for other entities
--
Assignment endpoints (CRUD)
Examination endpoints (CRUD)
Semester endpoints (CRUD)
--
Pattern: Controller (API Router)
Uses normalized schema with JOINs
Validates foreign key relationships
Type-safe parameter handling</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLClass</id><coordinates><x>1080</x><y>120</y><w>360</w><h>240</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Presentation Layer - Web&gt;&gt;
views.py + web/*.py
--
Jinja2 template-based web interface
--
+ views: APIRouter (for HTMX endpoints)
--
Key modules:
- views.py: Main routes, subject lookup
- semester_views.py: Semester detail pages
- course_views.py: Course management
- assignment_views.py: Assignment forms
- exam_views.py: Exam management
- subject_views.py: Subject detail pages
--
Pattern: MVC (Controller + View)
Uses Service Layer for business logic
Returns rendered HTML (HTMX + Tailwind)</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLClass</id><coordinates><x>1480</x><y>120</y><w>280</w><h>200</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Presentation Layer - API&gt;&gt;
deps.py
--
FastAPI dependency providers
--
+ get_session() → Generator[Session]
--
Pattern: Dependency Injection
Provides DB session to API routes
Ensures session lifecycle management
(Created per request, auto-closed)</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLClass</id><coordinates><x>1480</x><y>360</y><w>280</w><h>240</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Presentation Layer - API&gt;&gt;
schemas.py
--
Pydantic request/response models
--
+ SubjectCreate / SubjectRead
+ AssignmentCreate / AssignmentRead
+ ExaminationCreate / ExaminationRead
+ SemesterCreate / SemesterRead
--
Pattern: DTO (Data Transfer Object)
Separates API contracts from ORM models
Enables validation and serialization
Uses Pydantic v2 model_config</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLClass</id><coordinates><x>720</x><y>744</y><w>360</w><h>224</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Application Entry&gt;&gt;
main.py
--
FastAPI application initialization
--
+ app: FastAPI
+ lifespan(app): AsyncContextManager
--
Responsibilities:
- Create DB tables (startup)
- Configure Jinja2 environment
- Mount API routers (versioned /api/v1)
- Mount web routers (/)
- Serve static files (/static, /assets)
- Session middleware
- Health check endpoint (/healthz)
--
Pattern: Application Factory
Orchestrates all layers</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element><element><id>Relation</id><coordinates><x>144</x><y>352</y><w>56</w><h>104</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>lt=&lt;.
